  cons         : gain =  -0.129170   mean lag =   98.39 periods

  self-check  max |beta' gain| = 1.146e-04
  beta'Y_t is stationary, so no shock can move it permanently: this is
  zero by construction, and it exercises the weights, the level map and
  the orthogonalisation at once.  The gain matrix has rank M - r = 2.


